{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a Turn-based Roguelite RPG with Unique Battle Mechanics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your band of 4 heroes through the world of Valor of Man. Build your party from 12 unique hero classes. Create powerful synergies as you master 700+ abilities, items and game-changing artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699280/extras/915405427e07a1509f8be13bccba38a9.poster.avif?t=1763202328\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699280/extras/915405427e07a1509f8be13bccba38a9.webm?t=1763202328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699280/extras/915405427e07a1509f8be13bccba38a9.mp4?t=1763202328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engage with a Responsive DnD-style Battle System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up your heroes and wreak havoc on your foes. Unleash devastating critical hits to cripple your enemies. Challenge powerful bosses with unique behaviours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699280/extras/bb86281b21f730374dcc780e7b26c2e9.poster.avif?t=1763202328\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699280/extras/bb86281b21f730374dcc780e7b26c2e9.webm?t=1763202328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699280/extras/bb86281b21f730374dcc780e7b26c2e9.mp4?t=1763202328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dive into an Evolving Roguelite Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make crucial choices as you venture through procedurally generated chapters. Discover an intriguing narrative that unfolds with the completion of each run. Conquer 10 progressive difficulties and overcome ever-increasing odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699280/extras/bd59c89ff25fe31564d070cc6160a5ea.poster.avif?t=1763202328\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699280/extras/bd59c89ff25fe31564d070cc6160a5ea.webm?t=1763202328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699280/extras/bd59c89ff25fe31564d070cc6160a5ea.mp4?t=1763202328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immerse Yourself in Endless Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your power with a wealth of unlockables after each run. Enjoy short, replayable sessions where no run is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699280/extras/badf4b1ea2b286ebb9157997d05abf49.poster.avif?t=1763202328\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699280/extras/badf4b1ea2b286ebb9157997d05abf49.webm?t=1763202328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699280/extras/badf4b1ea2b286ebb9157997d05abf49.mp4?t=1763202328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.